      "value": "<p>You gain the following Cunning Strike option.</p><p><strong>Terrify (Cost: 1d6).</strong> The target must succeed on a Wisdom saving throw or have the Frightened condition for 1 minute. While it is Frightened this way, you have Advantage on attack rolls against it. It repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.</p>",
